  "bodyText": "Skip to main content\nEnable accessibility for low vision\nOpen the accessibility menu\nSkip to content\nMasterplan Communities\nOverview\nAssembly Park\nBayview Village\nCloverdale\nMaplewood\nOakridge Park\nTriCity Central\nResidential Portfolio\nAll Communities\nCalgary\nCambridge\nHamilton\nKitchener\nGreater Toronto\nGreater Vancouver\nAbout\nNews & Insights\nContact\n \n \n(604) 913-7366\nQuadReal CONNECT \nFloorplans\nAmenities\nNeighbourhood\nGallery\nContact\nBook a Tour\n\nLARCHWAY GARDENS > FLOORPLANS\n\n1 and 2 Bedroom Floor Plans\n\nIf you’re looking for a spacious retreat in Kitsilano, you’ll find it here at Larchway Gardens. Our 1 bedroom apartments offer ample living space for your enjoyment, and for those looking for even more space, we have roomy 2 bedroom apartments as well. Regardless of your floor plan, you’ll love having the comfort of a large living space with access to your own private balcony.\n\nAll suites are unfurnished. Displayed price valid for move-ins up to 60 days out.\n\nLimited Time Offer\n\nNo floorplans match your search.\n\nRenderings and pictures shown are for illustration purposes only and are intended as general reference. Square footage, dimensions, features, materials, and layout of subject suite may be different than shown.\n\nPlease be advised that employees of QuadReal Residential Properties only represent the owner of the property and will be solely looking after the owner’s interests. BC Financial Services Authority (BCFSA) requires that we disclose these matters to you. If you are interested in renting a particular suite, you will be required to complete an online application.\nAs part of the application there will be a form regarding disclosure: Disclosure for Residential Tenancies.\n\nDisplayed price valid for move-ins up to 60 days out.\n\nLooking for something else?\n\nJoin our waitlists to be notified when other options become available.\n\nWaitlist: One Bedroom Suites\n\nJoin Waitlist\n\nWaitlist: Two Bedroom Suites\n\nJoin Waitlist\nCan't find the suite you seek?\n\nCheck out our neighbouring Sister Properties to review their availabilities.\n\nDunway Court\n\n3550 West Broadway Street\n\nVancouver, BC V6R 2B6\n\n2 Bed | 1 Bath\n\n790 sq.ft.\n\n$3,240\n\nView Floorplans\nVisit Website\n\nAddress\n\n2475 West Broadway Street\n\nVancouver, BC V6K 2E8\n\n(604) 913-7366\nFloorplans\nAmenities\nNeighbourhood\nGallery\nContact\nAll Units Are Rented\nEmpty heading\nEmpty heading\n\n \n\nVisit Dunway Court for more available units to rent!\n\nRent with us\nOwn with us\nMasterplan Communities\nResidential Portfolio\nAbout\nNews & Insights\nContact\nStay up to date\n\nJoin our mailing list to receive future updates,\nnews, and insights.\n\nSubscribe\nQuadReal CONNECT\n \n \n\n© 2026 QuadReal and the Quadrant Logo are trademarks of QuadReal Property Group Limited Partnership. All rights reserved.\nIllustrations are Artists' concept. Prices and specifications are subject to change without notice. E.&O.E.\n\nQuadReal Residential Properties UK\nAccessibility\nLegal\nWe use essential cookies to help us keep our site running, understand and improve its performance, and save any settings you select. With your consent by clicking \"Accept all Cookies\" or through cookies settings, we use cookies or similar technologies to enhance site navigation, analyze site usage, assist in our marketing efforts, enable user choice, and improve our sites. We also provide personalized content and advertising. To manage your preference and your cookies click on “Cookies Settings”. For details of our privacy practice, see our Privacy Policy.\nCookies Settings Reject All Non-Essential Cookies Accept All Cookies",
